# For agent images built from the repo root (`avp agent install pd
# agents/avp-pydantic-ai/python/Dockerfile --context .`), which install the SDK
# by path until it is on PyPI. Send only the SDK and the agents being built.
*
!avp-sdk/python
!agents/avp-pydantic-ai/python
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
